"Commercial lines with allocated training places are fixed. Use a controlled "
"commercial revision."
msgstr ""
"Les lignes commerciales comportant des lots de formation sont figées. "
"Utilisez une révision commerciale contrôlée."

#. module: training_management_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/training_management_sale/models/training_allocation.py:0
